OL,3,AFires lit on streets across France
OL,4,Aafter student protests force hundreds
OL,5,Aof schools to close
OL,6,
OL,7,FFires are burning across parts of
OL,8,FFrance as riot police are responding to
OL,9,Fstudent protests over school conditions
OL,11,FImages from this afternoon show burning
OL,12,Fbarricades in Pantin, bins set alight
OL,13,Fin Paris and crowds of protesters and
OL,14,Friot police on the streets
OL,16,FMore than 500 schools are facing
OL,17,Fdisruption. At least 65 staff members
OL,18,Fhave been injured in the unrest, the
OL,19,Fcountry's education ministry says
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
