OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1790948892
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASchool protests send shivers down
OL,4,AFrench government's spine
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a piece of wisdom that all French
OL,7,Fleaders take care to heed: young people
OL,8,Fon the street equals trouble.
OL,10,FSince the student protests of May 1968
OL,11,F` memorably described by President De
OL,12,FGaulle as chienlit (bed defecation, in
OL,13,Fother words chaos) ` every government
OL,14,Fhas run scared of angry French youth.
OL,16,FWhy? Because youth movements are
OL,17,Funpredictable and shapeless, often with
OL,18,Fno clear structure to negotiate with.
OL,19,FBecause when they protest, other groups
OL,20,Fjoin in.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1790948892
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASchool protests send shivers down
OL,4,AFrench government's spine
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlso: because as they're young, the
OL,7,Fpublic tends to sympathise. And because
OL,8,Fif the police mess up and cause injury
OL,9,For worse, then the consequences are
OL,10,Fincalculable. And presidential
OL,11,Felections are only months away.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
