OL,3,AChrista Pike in critical condition
OL,4,Aafter surviving two lethal injections,
OL,5,Alawyer says
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer lawyers are now asking for her
OL,8,Fsentence to be commuted. Pike, 50, was
OL,9,Fsentenced to death in 1996 for the
OL,10,Fmurder of Colleen Slemmer.
OL,12,FShe was injected with two lethal doses
OL,13,Fof pentobarbital on Wednesday but
OL,14,Fremained alive, her lawyers said. She
OL,15,Fwas then sent to hospital in an
OL,16,Fambulance.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
